{
  "id": "prologue_arrival",
  "title": "毕业旅行",
  "background": "prologue_mountain_bus_arrival",
  "bgm": "bgm_prologue",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "山道弯过最后一道急转，绿皮中巴在牌坊前缓缓停下。引擎熄火的一瞬，山雀也安静下来。",
      "next": "linya_phone"
    },
    {
      "id": "linya_phone",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "林雅",
      "activeSide": "right",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_normal_modern",
      "text": "看，就是这里——朱砂镇。小红书上那个博主拍的就是这条石牌坊。她说傍晚灯笼一亮，朱砂红铺一地，简直绝杀。",
      "next": "xiaoyue_first_look"
    },
    {
      "id": "xiaoyue_first_look",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "小月",
      "activeSide": "left",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_normal_modern",
      "text": "嗯……是好看。可是评论区怎么全是“随缘游客少”这种好评？连一张差评都没有，反而有点奇怪。",
      "next": "linya_brush"
    },
    {
      "id": "linya_brush",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "林雅",
      "activeSide": "right",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_normal_modern",
      "text": "你想多啦。小众景点本来就这样，越没人去越出片。来都来了，先下车呗？",
      "next": "driver_warn"
    },
    {
      "id": "driver_warn",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "司机",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_normal_modern",
      "text": "（沙哑、不抬头）……两位姑娘，到站了。拍照归拍照——酉时之前，最好出来。",
      "next": "xiaoyue_press"
    },
    {
      "id": "xiaoyue_press",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "小月",
      "activeSide": "left",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_surprised_modern",
      "text": "酉时？师傅，您是说天黑之前吗？为什么是酉时？",
      "next": "driver_silence"
    },
    {
      "id": "driver_silence",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "司机",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_surprised_modern",
      "text": "（顿了一下，像是吞下半句话）……镇上规矩。生人，过了酉时就不是生人了。下车吧。",
      "next": "linya_giggle"
    },
    {
      "id": "linya_giggle",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "林雅",
      "activeSide": "right",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_surprised_modern",
      "text": "卧槽，这老爷子还玩气氛？是不是镇上请来的群演？小月，开机！我们这就是恐怖片女主出场镜头！",
      "next": "approach_arch"
    },
    {
      "id": "approach_arch",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "旁白",
      "text": "车门一关，柴油味散尽。石牌坊的影子被夕阳拉得很长，牌匾上四个金漆大字早已褪成暗红——朱砂遗镇。",
      "next": "xiaoyue_red_lantern"
    },
    {
      "id": "xiaoyue_red_lantern",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "小月",
      "activeSide": "left",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_normal_modern",
      "text": "你看那排灯笼……还没天黑就先亮起来了。而且，是从镇里面一盏一盏亮过来的。",
      "next": "linya_excited"
    },
    {
      "id": "linya_excited",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "林雅",
      "activeSide": "right",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_normal_modern",
      "text": "这才叫氛围！我手机都拍不完了。再发愣可就错过最好的光了——走，进去看看！",
      "next": "choice_enter"
    },
    {
      "id": "choice_enter",
      "type": "choice",
      "speaker": "小月",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_normal_modern",
      "prompt": "牌坊后面，雾气从石阶缝里慢慢漫上来。",
      "autosave": true,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "enter_normal",
          "icon": "🎒",
          "label": "好，进去打卡",
          "consequence": "和林雅一起进镇",
          "next": "enter_resolved"
        },
        {
          "id": "enter_cautious",
          "icon": "🔍",
          "label": "先在镇口多看几眼",
          "consequence": "进镇前心里多了一根刺",
          "flag": "xiaoyueAlert",
          "next": "enter_resolved_cautious"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_driver_back",
          "icon": "🚌",
          "label": "回头问司机末班车几点",
          "consequence": "记下最后一班离镇时间",
          "flag": "knowsLastBus",
          "next": "ask_driver_back"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_driver_back",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "司机",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_normal_modern",
      "text": "（透过车窗）……末班车？酉时整，停在牌坊外。过了点，我开不开都一样——车进不去。",
      "next": "enter_resolved_cautious"
    },
    {
      "id": "enter_resolved",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "林雅",
      "activeSide": "right",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_normal_modern",
      "text": "走啦走啦，先在主街转两圈找机位，等会儿光最好的时候我们去汉服馆挑衣服。",
      "next": "enter_resolved_end"
    },
    {
      "id": "enter_resolved_cautious",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "小月",
      "activeSide": "left",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_normal_modern",
      "text": "好。不过我们说好，先在街上听听镇里人怎么说，再决定要不要换衣服。",
      "next": "enter_resolved_end"
    },
    {
      "id": "enter_resolved_end",
      "type": "ending",
      "title": "进入朱砂镇",
      "left": "xiaoyue_normal_modern",
      "right": "linya_normal_modern",
      "text": "雾从牌坊后漫出来，石路尽头的红灯笼，一盏接一盏亮起。"
    }
  ]
}
